Description: Edge-first, offline-first, responsible-AI operating system
 Arikizu packages a Rust runtime and a set of Python worker processes
 under one capability API with a browser dashboard and a human-in-the-loop
 approval queue. One install owns vision, audio, documents, time series,
 reasoning, memory, policy enforcement, and audit on a single edge device.
 .
 The binary is cross-compiled for aarch64 in CI; Python workers ship as
 pre-built wheels. No build toolchain is installed on the target.
